<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Q3 unemployment stays at 6.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Israel's Q3 unemployment stays at 6.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following indicator on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			    Q3 1996   Q2 1996   Q3 1995</p>
<p>Unemployment	    6.4 pct   6.4 pct   6.7 pct</p>
<p>(seasonally adjusted)</p>
<p>The number of unemployed was 140,000, up 0.72 percent from the previous quarter and down 0.71 percent from the same quarter last year.</p>
<p>The number of employed was 2.04 million, an increase 0.08 percent from the previous quarter and 3.3 percent from a year earlier. The number of people in the civilian labour force was 2.179 million.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
